# Sub-Agents — {{ agent_name }} {{ agent_emoji }}

This directory contains sub-agent configurations for delegated tasks.

## Model Routing

| Role | Model |
|------|-------|
| Main agent | `{{ primary_model }}` |
| Sub-agents (default) | `{{ fallback_model }}` |

## How Sub-Agents Work

{{ agent_name }} spawns sub-agents for tasks that:
- Take more than ~2 minutes of focused work
- Can run in parallel with the main session
- Are well-defined enough to delegate without constant oversight

## Adding a Sub-Agent Task

1. Create a prompt file in `../prompts/`
2. Spawn via `sessions_spawn` with `runtime="subagent"`
3. Monitor via `subagents(action=list)`

## Config

Sub-agent model is set in `openclaw.json`:
```json
{
  "agents": {
    "defaults": {
      "subagents": {
        "maxConcurrent": 2,
        "model": {
          "primary": "{{ fallback_model }}"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```
